\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I give my heart to Thee,
\par O Jesus most desired!
\par And heart for heart the gift shall  be,
\par For Thou my soul hast fired:
\par Thou hearts alone wouldst move,
\par Thou only hearts dost love;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I would love Thee, as Thou lov'st me,
\par O Jesus most desired!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. What offering can I make,
\par Dear Lord, to love like Thine?
\par That Thou, the Word, didst stoop
\par to take
\par A human form like mine!
\par Give Me thy heart, My son:
\par Lord, Thou my heart hast won:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I would love Thee, as Thou lov'st me,
\par O Jesus most desired!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Here finds my heart its rest,
\par Repose that knows no shock,
\par The strength of love that keeps it blest,
\par In Thee, the riven Rock:
\par My soul, as girt  around,
\par Her citadel hath found:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I would love Thee, as Thou lov'st me,
\par O Jesus most desired!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

